{
    "info": {
        "_postman_id": "yii3-api-boilerplate",
        "name": "Yii3 API",
        "description": "Yii3 API boilerplate collection. Auth dan variable disimpan di level collection sehingga semua request mewarisinya. Set variable {{bearer-token}} dengan JWT dari SSO, atau service token (bila app.service_token.enabled=true).",
        "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
    },
    "auth": {
        "type": "bearer",
        "bearer": [
            { "key": "token", "value": "{{bearer-token}}", "type": "string" }
        ]
    },
    "item": [
        {
            "name": "Local",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "Index",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "description": "Health check root API (environment Local).\n\nMengembalikan info dasar API (name, version, environment). Path ini termasuk public path (app.jwt.publicPaths) sehingga bisa dipanggil tanpa Bearer token — berguna untuk smoke test bahwa server hidup.",
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{url-local}}/api/v1/",
                            "host": ["{{url-local}}"],
                            "path": ["api", "v1", ""]
                        }
                    }
                },
                {
                    "name": "AnotherExample - List",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "description": "Daftar AnotherExample dengan paginasi (environment Local).\n\nPermission: another-example.index. Butuh Bearer token valid (JWT atau service token).\n\nQuery params opsional: page, page_size (1-200), sort_by, sort_dir (asc|desc), plus filter field seperti id, name, status, example_id.",
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{url-local}}/api/v1/another-example",
                            "host": ["{{url-local}}"],
                            "path": ["api", "v1", "another-example"]
                        }
                    }
                },
                {
                    "name": "AnotherExample - Create",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "POST",
                        "description": "Buat record AnotherExample baru (environment Local).\n\nPermission: another-example.create. Field example_id adalah FK ke tabel example (parent) — harus merujuk record Example yang ada. detail_info audit (created_by, created_at, dst.) diisi otomatis oleh server dari actor yang terautentikasi; field ini boleh dikirim null.",
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n    \"name\": \"Another example\",\n    \"status\": 1,\n    \"example_id\": 1,\n    \"detail_info\": null\n}",
                            "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                        },
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{url-local}}/api/v1/another-example/create",
                            "host": ["{{url-local}}"],
                            "path": ["api", "v1", "another-example", "create"]
                        }
                    }
                },
                {
                    "name": "System",
                    "item": [
                        {
                            "name": "ServiceToken - Issue (Create)",
                            "request": {
                                "method": "POST",
                                "description": "Terbitkan service token baru (environment Local).\n\nPermission: system.service-token.create. Butuh Bearer token valid — request ini dilakukan user internal yang sudah login (SSO/JWT) untuk menerbitkan token bagi sistem eksternal.\n\nPENTING: plaintext token hanya muncul sekali di data.token — yang disimpan di DB hanya SHA-256-nya. Simpan baik-baik, lalu set ke variable {{bearer-token}} untuk request machine-to-machine selanjutnya.\n\nField: username (wajib, unique — identitas service, bukan username penerbit), name (wajib), abilities (opsional, array string), whitelist_host (opsional, default [] = allow all; dukung wildcard 192.168.1.* / *.pos.local), expires_at (opsional, Y-m-d atau Y-m-d H:i:s; kosong = tidak pernah expired).\n\nFitur ini opt-in: butuh app.service_token.enabled=true di .env.",
                                "body": {
                                    "mode": "raw",
                                    "raw": "{\n    \"username\": \"pos_cabang_a\",\n    \"name\": \"Aplikasi Kasir Cabang A\",\n    \"abilities\": [\"read:products\", \"write:transactions\"],\n    \"whitelist_host\": [],\n    \"expires_at\": \"\"\n}",
                                    "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                                },
                                "url": {
                                    "raw": "{{url-local}}/api/v1/system/service-token/create",
                                    "host": ["{{url-local}}"],
                                    "path": ["api", "v1", "system", "service-token", "create"]
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "name": "ServiceToken - List (Data)",
                            "request": {
                                "method": "POST",
                                "description": "Daftar service token dengan paginasi (environment Local).\n\nPermission: system.service-token.list. Hash token tidak pernah ditampilkan di list/view.\n\nFilter exact: id, user_id, status. Filter LIKE: username, name. Sortable: id, user_id, username, name, last_used_at, expires_at, created_at, status.",
                                "body": {
                                    "mode": "raw",
                                    "raw": "{\n    \"filter\": {\n        \"username\": \"pos\",\n        \"status\": 1\n    },\n    \"page\": 1,\n    \"page_size\": 20,\n    \"sort\": {\n        \"by\": \"id\",\n        \"dir\": \"asc\"\n    }\n}",
                                    "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                                },
                                "url": {
                                    "raw": "{{url-local}}/api/v1/system/service-token/data",
                                    "host": ["{{url-local}}"],
                                    "path": ["api", "v1", "system", "service-token", "data"]
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "name": "ServiceToken - View",
                            "request": {
                                "method": "GET",
                                "description": "Detail satu service token by id (environment Local).\n\nPermission: system.service-token.view. Ganti {id} di URL dengan id token.",
                                "url": {
                                    "raw": "{{url-local}}/api/v1/system/service-token/1",
                                    "host": ["{{url-local}}"],
                                    "path": ["api", "v1", "system", "service-token", "1"]
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "name": "ServiceToken - Update / Rotate",
                            "request": {
                                "method": "PUT",
                                "description": "Update service token (environment Local).\n\nPermission: system.service-token.update. Ganti {id} di URL dengan id token.\n\n- username bisa di-rename (tetap unique, duplikat → 409).\n- regenerate: true me-rotate secret — bearer lama langsung mati, plaintext baru dikembalikan sekali di data.token.\n- status: 1 active, 0 inactive.\n- expires_at kosong tidak meng-clear expiry (field kosong = tidak berubah).",
                                "body": {
                                    "mode": "raw",
                                    "raw": "{\n    \"username\": \"pos_cabang_a\",\n    \"name\": \"Aplikasi Kasir Cabang A\",\n    \"abilities\": [\"read:products\"],\n    \"whitelist_host\": [],\n    \"expires_at\": \"\",\n    \"regenerate\": false,\n    \"status\": 1\n}",
                                    "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                                },
                                "url": {
                                    "raw": "{{url-local}}/api/v1/system/service-token/1",
                                    "host": ["{{url-local}}"],
                                    "path": ["api", "v1", "system", "service-token", "1"]
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "name": "ServiceToken - Revoke (Delete)",
                            "request": {
                                "method": "DELETE",
                                "description": "Revoke service token (soft delete, environment Local).\n\nPermission: system.service-token.delete. Ganti {id} di URL dengan id token. Efek langsung — bearer token berhenti berfungsi pada request berikutnya (tidak ada caching lookup).",
                                "url": {
                                    "raw": "{{url-local}}/api/v1/system/service-token/1",
                                    "host": ["{{url-local}}"],
                                    "path": ["api", "v1", "system", "service-token", "1"]
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "name": "Cache - Purge",
                            "request": {
                                "method": "POST",
                                "description": "Purge semua cache yang tergenerate (environment Local).\n\nPermission: system.cache.purge.\n\nMembersihkan semua store cache yang mungkin terisi: PSR-16 cache (binding project), Yii cache (getOrSet wrapper), FileCache di @runtime/cache (termasuk DB schema cache), Redis (flushDB pada database terkonfigurasi — hanya bila redis.default.enabled=true), OPcache (bila extension aktif), dan realpath/stat cache.\n\nResponse data.results melaporkan status per store: purged, skipped (tidak terpasang/disabled — bukan error), atau failed (pesan di detail).",
                                "url": {
                                    "raw": "{{url-local}}/api/v1/system/cache/purge",
                                    "host": ["{{url-local}}"],
                                    "path": ["api", "v1", "system", "cache", "purge"]
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "name": "Dev",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "Index",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "description": "Health check root API (environment Dev).\n\nSama seperti Local/Index — endpoint public untuk memastikan server Dev merespons. Sesuaikan variable {{url-dev}} dengan domain Dev yang sebenarnya.",
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{url-dev}}/api/v1/",
                            "host": ["{{url-dev}}"],
                            "path": ["api", "v1", ""]
                        }
                    }
                },
                {
                    "name": "AnotherExample - List",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "description": "Daftar AnotherExample dengan paginasi (environment Dev).\n\nPermission: another-example.index. Butuh Bearer token valid yang diterbitkan untuk environment Dev (issuer/audience JWT berbeda per environment — token Local belum tentu valid di Dev).",
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{url-dev}}/api/v1/another-example",
                            "host": ["{{url-dev}}"],
                            "path": ["api", "v1", "another-example"]
                        }
                    }
                },
                {
                    "name": "AnotherExample - Create",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "POST",
                        "description": "Buat record AnotherExample baru (environment Dev).\n\nPermission: another-example.create. example_id harus merujuk record Example yang ada di database Dev, bukan Local. detail_info audit diisi otomatis dari actor yang terautentikasi.",
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n    \"name\": \"Another example\",\n    \"status\": 1,\n    \"example_id\": 1,\n    \"detail_info\": null\n}",
                            "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                        },
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{url-dev}}/api/v1/another-example/create",
                            "host": ["{{url-dev}}"],
                            "path": ["api", "v1", "another-example", "create"]
                        }
                    }
                },
                {
                    "name": "System",
                    "item": [
                        {
                            "name": "ServiceToken - Issue (Create)",
                            "request": {
                                "method": "POST",
                                "description": "Terbitkan service token baru (environment Dev).\n\nPermission: system.service-token.create. Butuh Bearer token valid yang diterbitkan untuk environment Dev.\n\nPENTING: plaintext token hanya muncul sekali di data.token — yang disimpan di DB hanya SHA-256-nya.\n\nFitur ini opt-in: butuh app.service_token.enabled=true di .env environment Dev.",
                                "body": {
                                    "mode": "raw",
                                    "raw": "{\n    \"username\": \"pos_cabang_a\",\n    \"name\": \"Aplikasi Kasir Cabang A\",\n    \"abilities\": [\"read:products\", \"write:transactions\"],\n    \"whitelist_host\": [],\n    \"expires_at\": \"\"\n}",
                                    "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                                },
                                "url": {
                                    "raw": "{{url-dev}}/api/v1/system/service-token/create",
                                    "host": ["{{url-dev}}"],
                                    "path": ["api", "v1", "system", "service-token", "create"]
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "name": "ServiceToken - List (Data)",
                            "request": {
                                "method": "POST",
                                "description": "Daftar service token dengan paginasi (environment Dev).\n\nPermission: system.service-token.list. Hash token tidak pernah ditampilkan di list/view.\n\nFilter exact: id, user_id, status. Filter LIKE: username, name. Sortable: id, user_id, username, name, last_used_at, expires_at, created_at, status.",
                                "body": {
                                    "mode": "raw",
                                    "raw": "{\n    \"filter\": {\n        \"username\": \"pos\",\n        \"status\": 1\n    },\n    \"page\": 1,\n    \"page_size\": 20,\n    \"sort\": {\n        \"by\": \"id\",\n        \"dir\": \"asc\"\n    }\n}",
                                    "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                                },
                                "url": {
                                    "raw": "{{url-dev}}/api/v1/system/service-token/data",
                                    "host": ["{{url-dev}}"],
                                    "path": ["api", "v1", "system", "service-token", "data"]
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "name": "ServiceToken - View",
                            "request": {
                                "method": "GET",
                                "description": "Detail satu service token by id (environment Dev).\n\nPermission: system.service-token.view. Ganti {id} di URL dengan id token.",
                                "url": {
                                    "raw": "{{url-dev}}/api/v1/system/service-token/1",
                                    "host": ["{{url-dev}}"],
                                    "path": ["api", "v1", "system", "service-token", "1"]
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "name": "ServiceToken - Update / Rotate",
                            "request": {
                                "method": "PUT",
                                "description": "Update service token (environment Dev).\n\nPermission: system.service-token.update. Ganti {id} di URL dengan id token.\n\n- username bisa di-rename (tetap unique, duplikat → 409).\n- regenerate: true me-rotate secret — bearer lama langsung mati, plaintext baru dikembalikan sekali di data.token.\n- status: 1 active, 0 inactive.",
                                "body": {
                                    "mode": "raw",
                                    "raw": "{\n    \"username\": \"pos_cabang_a\",\n    \"name\": \"Aplikasi Kasir Cabang A\",\n    \"abilities\": [\"read:products\"],\n    \"whitelist_host\": [],\n    \"expires_at\": \"\",\n    \"regenerate\": false,\n    \"status\": 1\n}",
                                    "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                                },
                                "url": {
                                    "raw": "{{url-dev}}/api/v1/system/service-token/1",
                                    "host": ["{{url-dev}}"],
                                    "path": ["api", "v1", "system", "service-token", "1"]
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "name": "ServiceToken - Revoke (Delete)",
                            "request": {
                                "method": "DELETE",
                                "description": "Revoke service token (soft delete, environment Dev).\n\nPermission: system.service-token.delete. Ganti {id} di URL dengan id token. Efek langsung — bearer token berhenti berfungsi pada request berikutnya.",
                                "url": {
                                    "raw": "{{url-dev}}/api/v1/system/service-token/1",
                                    "host": ["{{url-dev}}"],
                                    "path": ["api", "v1", "system", "service-token", "1"]
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "name": "Cache - Purge",
                            "request": {
                                "method": "POST",
                                "description": "Purge semua cache yang tergenerate (environment Dev).\n\nPermission: system.cache.purge.\n\nMembersihkan semua store cache: PSR-16 cache, Yii cache, FileCache @runtime/cache (termasuk DB schema cache), Redis (flushDB — hanya bila enabled), OPcache, dan realpath/stat cache.\n\nResponse data.results melaporkan status per store: purged, skipped, atau failed (pesan di detail).",
                                "url": {
                                    "raw": "{{url-dev}}/api/v1/system/cache/purge",
                                    "host": ["{{url-dev}}"],
                                    "path": ["api", "v1", "system", "cache", "purge"]
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ],
    "variable": [
        { "key": "url-local", "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
        { "key": "url-dev", "value": "https://dev.example.com", "type": "string" },
        { "key": "bearer-token", "value": "", "type": "string" }
    ]
}
